From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jorge Trigger <lordchronotrigger@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:55:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Diagnostics: trace residency and shell teardown waits

An M2 iPad stackshot places a black-screen replay thread inside Metal residency
commit. Record the batch and caller before that call, and the shell teardown
steps before their waits, with opt-in synchronous checkpoints. Preserve the
existing lock and teardown ordering. No recovery or root-cause fix is claimed.

The related upstream report is a different game and device. This local
diagnostic has not been submitted upstream.

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: Identify the next black-screen and exit wait on the personal iPad build
Issue: seedds/nxnative#2098 (related wait, shared cause unconfirmed)
